# r1115 phase 1, boot B1: group B fresh normal world, seed 8675309, full pack (NOSWAP=1), level p1b1.
# Server: NOSWAP=1 bash tools/scratch_query/prep_srv.sh OUT p1b1 B difficulty=normal
# Before boot: zz_c3_probe.js, zz_zact_probe.js, zz_hh_mw_probe.js, zz_zq_heapcol.js (r1115 copy: blocks/air lines).
# Rows: SQ-CBP-11, SQ-OB-05, SQ-VH-06, -06b, -06c (fresh Nether), SQ-HH-328 seed 8675309 (shipped 120 s deadline).
pace 1

## SQ-P1B-setup | gamerules, spawn platform, bot (not a test row)
> gamerule doDaylightCycle false
> gamerule doMobSpawning false
> time set noon
> weather clear
> forceload add 0 0
> setblock 0 199 0 minecraft:stone
> setblock 0 199 2 minecraft:stone
> pbot spawn cb 0.5 200 0.5 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3

## SQ-CBP-11 | transitions in Equipment (37); felsic_gear pack on; no incomplete or duplicate error; felsic ore in End highlands; block drops 1-2 scrap
shell grep -hE "transition items|end gear transition|mod data packs" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/latest.log | cut -c1-220
shell grep -qE "\[creativeequipment\] end gear transition items \(37\)" logs/kubejs/startup.log
bootreject incomplete\('[^']*'\) not registered
bootreject (Duplicate|duplicate).*kubejs:incomplete_
> datapack list
waitlog data packs? enabled 30
expect felsic_gear
> zq bytype create:sequenced_assembly
waitlog \[zq\] bytype create:sequenced_assembly: \d+ 60
> execute in minecraft:the_end run locate biome minecraft:end_highlands
waitlog nearest minecraft:end_highlands is at|Could not find 300
capture EH minecraft:end_highlands is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
> execute in minecraft:the_end run forceload add {EH1-40} {EH3-40} {EH1+39} {EH3+39}
sleep 60
> zq count {EH1-40} 0 {EH3-40} {EH1+39} 120 {EH3+39} felsic_gear:felsic_block minecraft:the_end
waitlog \[zq\] count felsic_gear:felsic_block: \d+ 300
expect \[zq\] count felsic_gear:felsic_block: [1-9]
> execute in minecraft:the_end run forceload remove {EH1-40} {EH3-40} {EH1+39} {EH3+39}
> setblock 0 200 2 felsic_gear:felsic_block
> zact break 0 200 2 minecraft:netherite_pickaxe
waitlog \[zact\] done 20
expect \[zact\] break.*creativeequipment:felsic_scrap x[1-2]\b
> setblock 0 200 2 felsic_gear:felsic_block
> zc3 loot 0 200 2 minecraft:netherite_pickaxe 50
waitlog \[c3\] done 20
> setblock 0 200 2 minecraft:air
expect \[c3\] loot .*creativeequipment:felsic_scrap x(5\d|6\d|7\d|8\d|9\d|100)\b
look Equipment 37 transitions, Engineering count lower; felsic_gear pack enabled; ore in End highlands; one break 1-2 scrap; 50 rolls between 50 and 100 (uniform 1-2 = about 75)

## SQ-OB-05 | cave carrot cutting and baked cutting, and their Slice & Dice copies: 2 raw / 2 cooked veggie patties
> give cb miners_delight:cave_carrot 4
> zq rdetail veggie_patty_from
waitlog \[zq\] rdetail matching veggie_patty_from: \d+ 30
expect raw_veggie_patty_from_cave_carrot .*2 
expect cooked_veggie_patty_from_baked_cave_carrot .*2 
reject veggie_patty_from.*(minecraft:air|-> 0 )
look 4 recipes (2 cutting, 2 S&D copies): results 2 raw / 2 cooked veggie patties, inputs cave carrot / baked cave carrot, never air

## SQ-VH-06 | Heap: every non-air block in a 3x3 chunk area flesh or structure, 0 netherrack; floors/ceilings flesh 95 %; bedrock at 0 and 127
> execute in minecraft:the_nether run locate biome biomesoplenty:visceral_heap
waitlog (is at \[|Could not find) 120
capture H is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
> execute in minecraft:the_nether run forceload add {H1-24} {H3-24} {H1+23} {H3+23}
sleep 45
> zq count {H1-24} 0 {H3-24} {H1+23} 0 {H3+23} minecraft:bedrock minecraft:the_nether
waitlog \[zq\] count minecraft:bedrock: \d+ 120
> zq count {H1-24} 127 {H3-24} {H1+23} 127 {H3+23} minecraft:bedrock minecraft:the_nether
waitlog \[zq\] count minecraft:bedrock: \d+ 120
> zqh biomesoplenty:visceral_heap {H1-24} {H3-24} {H1+23} {H3+23} minecraft:the_nether
waitlog \[zqh\] done 300
reject \[zqh\] error
look bedrock counts 2304 each (48 x 48); blocks line netherrack 0; floor and ceiling flesh + porous_flesh >= 95 % of surfaces, the rest structure blocks

## SQ-VH-06b | caves inside the Heap (cave air, flesh walls); carver tag lists flesh and porous_flesh
> kubejs list_tag minecraft:block minecraft:nether_carver_replaceables
> zq blocktag minecraft:nether_carver_replaceables
waitlog \[zq\] blocktag minecraft:nether_carver_replaceables 30
expect blocktag minecraft:nether_carver_replaceables \(\d+\): .*biomesoplenty:flesh
expect blocktag minecraft:nether_carver_replaceables \(\d+\): .*biomesoplenty:porous_flesh
> execute in minecraft:the_nether run forceload remove {H1-24} {H3-24} {H1+23} {H3+23}
look the SQ-VH-06 "[zqh] air" line shows minecraft:cave_air inside the Heap (carved caves); tag holds both flesh blocks

